                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]If only the mountain were made of Moustaches[/h1]\r\n\r\nAhh, Moustache Mountain, a pixel art minimalist platformer with a man, a moustache, and a whole lot of wall jumping.\r\n\r\nThis is the game for you if you like rage baiting, nail biting extreme, err well maybe not that bad. It took me hours to get the hang of things, and then it was pretty easy.\r\n\r\nIt's an ok game but is actually pretty fun for a little while. Going for all the achievements may have you pulling out your moustache, or somebody else's.\r\n\r\n[h2]6.5/10[/h2]\r\n\r\n[h2][url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45905648-Gork%2527s-Game-Grind/]Check out my curated list of games[/url][/h2]",
